ate awareness and strengthen affinity for their innovative HarvestFresh Technology in refrigerators</a></h4><p class="card-text">Voltas Beko, a leading brand in the consumer appliances space, is excited to announce the launch of its new influencer campaign to promote its revolutionary HarvestFresh
